  "post_content": "<p>(22 fotos) Aquest dissabte al migdia s&#39;ha inaugurat al Museu de la Baronia de Ribesalbes, amb assit&egrave;ncia multitudin&agrave;ria, l&#39;exposici&oacute; de pintura de l&#39;ondense Bienve Garc&iacute;a Garrido, que estar&agrave; oberta fins dissabte 7 de juliol, en horari de 9 a 14 hores, de dilluns a divendres, i de 10 a 14 hores, dissabte.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/06/IMG_0153.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;alcalde, C&eacute;sar Pallar&eacute;s Torres, ha dit que es tracta d&#39;una gran ocasi&oacute; per a con&egrave;ixer l&#39;interessant obra de l&#39;artista i tamb&eacute; les diferents col&middot;leccions que s&#39;hi mostren al Museu de la Baronia.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expobienvegarciagarridomuseobaroniaribealbes/img_0117.jpg\" alt=\"img_0117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expobienvegarciagarridomuseobaroniaribealbes/img_0121.jpg\" alt=\"img_0121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expobienvegarciagarridomuseobaroniaribealbes/img_0122.jpg\" alt=\"img_0122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expobienvegarciagarridomuseobaroniaribealbes/img_0123.jpg\" alt=\"img_0123\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expobienvegarciagarridomuseobaroniaribealbes/img_0124.jpg\" alt=\"img_0124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expobienvegarciagarridomuseobaroniaribealbes/img_0125.jpg\" alt=\"img_0125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4